SUMMARY:Advent Concert: Stars
LOCATION:Chapel
DESCRIPTION:The Chapel Choir and orchestra present a concert celebrating 
 the beauty and meaning of stars through Advent\, Christmas\, and Epiphan
 y. Featuring music of Johann Kuhnau\, B. E. Boykin\, Shawn Kirchner\, Ro
 land Carter\, and more. With Nicole Aldrich\, Director of Chapel Music\,
  and Eric Plutz\, University Organist.\nhttps://chapel.princeton.edu/eve
 nts/advent-concert-stars
